@startuml
 title QR boarding
autonumber
actor Driver
participant "application mobile" as app
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "notification-service" as NTF
participant "iam-service" as IAM
participant "route-service" as RTE
queue Kafka
participant "Proveedor push" as Push
actor Guardian

Driver -> app: scans QR of boarding
app -> GW: request of boarding
GW -> NTF: Procesa scan
NTF -> IAM: resolves identity
IAM --> NTF: identity of the Student
NTF -> RTE: validates assignment a route active
alt Student not valid or ya abordó
  RTE --> NTF: Rechaza
  NTF --> app: error of validación
else Student valid
  NTF -> NTF: records Boarding (BOARDING)
  NTF -> Kafka: publishes evento of boarding
  Kafka -> Push: delivery evento
  Push -> Guardian: notifies boarding, time and stop
  NTF --> app: boarding recorded
  app --> Driver: Student confirmado
end
@enduml

